WEBVTT

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.440
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:12.710
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:14.510
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:21.990
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.720
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:29.390
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:36.370
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:45.240
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:56.390
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.690 --> 00:01:00.600
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:04.260
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:11.410
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:20.280
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:02.220
Come forth, Weathers!

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:20.700
You summoned me, Your Excellency?

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:23.700
It is finally your turn, Weathers.

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:26.540
You are one in two, and two in one.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:31.540
With the power of those two faces,
you can seize humans with fear.

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:35.760
But of course.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.000
Go now!

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:44.300
I believe in your magical power!

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:51.370
Thank you, Your Excellency!

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:05.080
DEMON WEATHERS
THE SUN'S REVOLT

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.400
Man, it's so hot!

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:34.350
It's hot!

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:37.010
What in the hell?

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:38.790
It's like summer.

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:47.100
It's like being on the equator!

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:01.980
ICE

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:09.010
Wow, you started selling ice?

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:12.280
Well, with this weather,
I'm sure it'll be a hit!

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:14.620
Miyo, what's taking you?

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:18.020
This change happened so quickly,
maybe an earthquake is coming!

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:20.500
Good morning, Tare!

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.060
Good morning!

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.800
What's with the basket?

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:28.530
Oh, this? An homework.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:32.070
Huh? Homework? We had homework?

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.100
Huh? I mean... yeah, that's right!

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:38.710
We did, didn't we?

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.050
Right?

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:54.230
Wow, how cute!

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:56.260
When did you find him?

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:57.790
Last night.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:01.600
If Grandma sees him, I'm sure she'll
get mad and tell me to get rid of him.

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:04.160
She won't get rid of him. She'll
make him into sukiyaki!

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:06.100
Oh no!

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:09.600
Don't worry, Miyo.
You can keep him at my house!

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.910
Won't your mom get annoyed?

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:15.150
Of course not! How could she
hate a cute puppy like this?

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:26.790
Tare...

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:28.770
M-Miyo!

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:31.760
- Thank you, Tare!
- Miyo!

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:35.800
Let's raise this puppy together!

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:39.300
Anyway, it really is hot!

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:40.870
Hot!

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:42.770
Is it winter or summer?

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:45.310
What kind of clothes should
I buy from the pawn shop?

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:49.310
My athlete's foot itches
when it's hot! How annoying!

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:53.280
Damn! I can't even take a nap in this heat!

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:06.170
Then again, who'd nap at a time like this?

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.500
If we stay calm,
even fire will feel cool.

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:13.230
I'm far from your average
person, so I'm just fine!

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:15.980
I can handle any kind of heat!

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:24.750
No fair! Get that camera off me!
Get lost!

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:40.130
I can't believe we can
swim at this time of year.

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:42.300
Let's pretend we're in Hawaii.

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.780
Hey, who's that?

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:49.210
Hey Akira! Here I am!

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:52.380
It's Lala again!

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:01.010
LIFE

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:03.580
Everyone, quiet down!

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:08.420
I'll show you the elegant
traditional Japanese breast stroke!

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:11.630
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:14.230
Excuse me.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:23.650
I bent them too far!

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:29.990
All right, I shall begin now!

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:56.070
Whether it's hot or cold,
that's gotta be a new record!

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:00.720
So cold!

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.090
Help!

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:14.160
It's so cold!

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:22.430
What do we do?

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:24.240
Let's go!

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:32.320
Now I'm cold and itching all over!

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:44.320
This weather sure seems fishy.
What do you think, Lala?

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:46.800
I think it's really cold!

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:54.960
Oh no! I just made that special!

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:57.840
That's it, it must be him!

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:03.810
DEVIL!

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.620
Devil Wing!

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:36.540
Damn!

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:46.380
Ice Lock!

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:49.990
- What's with this ice?!
- It binds you.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.500
You're Demon Weathers!

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.500
Dammit!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:08.030
Try all you like, but it
will not break that easily!

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.240
Wh-What?!

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:13.810
Behold, Devilman!

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:19.350
There! Does it not seem to have grown?

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:21.260
It's expanding!

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.330
Soon, you will be trapped in ice!

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.740
Maybe it'll shatter if
I hit it with something!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.240
But...

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:49.350
There's nothing to hit it
with in midair!

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:14.310
That's it! There is one way!

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:24.390
Here I come, Weathers!

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:28.590
Wait!

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:34.000
I have no time for you.

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:37.770
Damn, he's quick to run!

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:42.170
Absolutely not!

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:45.570
No?

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:50.520
Certainly not! He'll disturb your
father if he starts whining.

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:54.820
No, he won't! If I tell Hachi not to...

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:57.520
Shh! Shut up, Hachi!

00:11:58.010 --> 00:12:00.520
He won't even listen to you now!

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:33.050
I'm sorry, Miyo.

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:37.560
That's all right.
It's not your fault, Tare.

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:41.590
It sure stinks to have such
unsympathetic parents.

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:44.590
But you've got it even worse.

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:04.040
How long are you
going to stay here?

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:07.580
Until someone finds him.
You can go home if you want, Tare.

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:10.060
No, that's okay.
I'll stay with you.

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.760
Welcome back, Tare.

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:17.130
Huh?

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:21.130
Hello, I'm Lala!

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:25.600
You look quite beautiful
for your age. Is Akira in?

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:27.100
Lala!

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:29.270
Hey, is Akira back yet?

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:30.600
No, not yet.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:34.010
How strange. I wonder if
he is still up in the sky?

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:35.580
- Huh?
- In the sky?

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:37.680
Y-You misheard me!

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:43.290
I mean he's probably wandering
around with his head in the clouds!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:46.260
Man, this is hard!

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:51.890
Devilman, where are you?

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.530
Where?

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:12.350
You must be severely injured, Devilman.

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:16.060
I shall enjoy it while it lasts.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.920
Hopefully he'll fall for it.

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:24.700
- Your friend?
- She's more like a rival.

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:28.570
Either way, I'm a beauty.
See you later!

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:33.040
This weather's crazy!

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:50.920
Miyo!

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:04.560
Hash“!

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:06.100
Miyo!

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:24.860
Hash“!

00:15:30.890 --> 00:15:31.960
Miyo...

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:38.240
Let's go home, Miyo.

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:40.770
Come on, hurry!

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:58.060
Miyo!

00:16:00.590 --> 00:16:03.160
I can't walk anymore.
Tare, you go alone!

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:05.600
No! I won't go without you!

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:11.580
Come on. I'll support you!

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:14.400
But I'm so heavy.

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:18.610
Never mind! Think of it as
a rehearsal for our wedding!

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:25.920
Tare went after the dog, didn't
he?! I'll go and look for him!

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:29.050
I'll come with you.

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:31.680
But you'll be too cold in that outfit.

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:32.890
Huh?

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:35.890
How's this?

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.270
What a weirdo!

00:16:57.650 --> 00:17:00.130
It's... pointless...

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:14.410
- I can't keep going!
- Leave it to me!

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:18.400
Coming right up!

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:19.700
Here you go, Miki.

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:20.910
When did you...

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.920
Don't you worry about that.
They're free to use, so go for it!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:34.590
Tare!

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:37.050
Yahoo!

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.750
Tare!

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:42.260
Hello!

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:55.810
- Can we find him?
- We have to!

00:17:59.170 --> 00:18:00.740
That dog!

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:03.850
It's Hachi!

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:10.850
Hachi! Are you taking us to Tare?

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:15.660
Let's go, Lala!

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:17.860
Okay! Hachi is such a good boy!

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:26.770
Freeze! Die filthy humans!

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:30.270
I can bend winter and summer to my will!

00:18:30.270 --> 00:18:33.340
Well, well!
Found you at last!

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.820
Devilman, what about your injury?

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:40.250
It healed ages ago. I was just pretending
in order to lure you out!

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:43.690
How dare you tricked me!

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:48.400
Devil Arrow!

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:54.830
Devil Kick!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.480
Tare! hang on!

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.180
Tare! Thank God!

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:09.780
It's summer now!

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:15.160
- Gosh, it's hot!
- I can't bear it.

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:17.990
Ice Coffin!

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:23.430
And this is how you get
rid of the Ice Coffin!

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:31.760
It's winter again!

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:33.710
And now it's summer again!

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:35.810
Fire Locker!

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:46.790
Devil Cutter!

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:53.060
Devil Beam!

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:08.010
In the end, you truly
were stronger than I...

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:22.050
Not too hot, not too cold...
the perfect place for a nap!

00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:24.520
Itchy! Oh, it's itchy!

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:27.690
My hair itches when it's
not too hot or too cold!

00:20:27.690 --> 00:20:30.130
What a teacher!

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:49.870
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:56.580
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.420 --> 00:21:04.230
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:10.070
Who Devilman really is

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:14.030
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:17.240
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:22.240
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:33.090
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:53.120
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:59.350
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:04.850
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:11.950
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:16.730
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:19.730
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:26.410
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:36.550
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:22:55.270 --> 00:22:58.970
The beautiful Demon Alron's
maxi dress attacks the city.

00:22:58.970 --> 00:23:01.590
MURATA CO.

00:23:03.010 --> 00:23:05.350
FOR MEDICINE
RECOVERY PHARMACEUTICALS

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:10.250
I can't breathe!

00:23:10.250 --> 00:23:11.920
Help!

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:15.830
Boy, come over here!

00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:30.370
He is late! The moon has already risen!

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:33.180
That Devilman, where could he be?

00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:39.710
Well, hello there!
If it isn't, lil' Alron!

00:23:39.710 --> 00:23:41.550
- I've been waiting!
- You're Lala!

00:23:41.550 --> 00:23:44.480
That's right!
The most beautiful demon!

00:23:44.480 --> 00:23:46.690
I'll fight you in Devilman's place!

00:23:47.890 --> 00:23:51.860
Oh! Oh my! Oh my! Oh my!

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:54.940
You bitch!

00:24:00.230 --> 00:24:03.010
Alron!
Alron, where did you go?

00:24:03.770 --> 00:24:05.510
Behind you! Behind you!

00:24:06.240 --> 00:24:08.380
What?! Dammit!

00:24:13.310 --> 00:24:15.820
I shall tear your wings off!

00:24:16.880 --> 00:24:18.020
Damn...

00:24:19.620 --> 00:24:22.400
Not even Devilman can fight against this!

00:24:27.060 --> 00:24:29.300
You will die, Devilman!

00:24:38.670 --> 00:24:41.780
The deadly, bitter battle continues.

00:24:42.740 --> 00:24:43.840
Next time on Devilman:

00:24:43.840 --> 00:24:47.290
DEMON ALRON
THE TERRIFYING DRESS
